@ETOMS_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5137

GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@tournamentId = 1
@teamId = 1
@affiliateCode = ABC123
@gameId = 1
@season = 2026

### Public tournament landing data
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing public tournament
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/tournaments/999999
Accept: application/json

### Public share page with Open Graph metadata
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/share/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}?ref={{affiliateCode}}

### Record an affiliate visit
POST {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/affiliate-links/{{affiliateCode}}/visit

### QR code for the tournament
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/qr.svg?code={{affiliateCode}}

### Square promotional material
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/materials/square.svg?code={{affiliateCode}}

### Leaderboard, optionally filtered by game and season
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/rankings?gameId={{gameId}}&season={{season}}
Accept: application/json

### Available leaderboard seasons
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/rankings/seasons?gameId={{gameId}}
Accept: application/json

### Public team ranking profile
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/rankings/teams/{{teamId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing public team profile
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/rankings/teams/999999
Accept: application/json

### Organizer tournaments (requires a demo login session)
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/mine/tournaments
Accept: application/json

### Organizer affiliate links (requires a demo login session)
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/affiliate-links
Accept: application/json

### Create an organizer affiliate link (requires a demo login session)
POST {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/marketing/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/affiliate-links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Kênh cộng đồng"
}

### Organizer tournament report (requires a demo login session)
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Organizer report workbook (requires a demo login session)
GET {{ETOMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/excel
